---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import MHRafinImage from "../../images/mhrafin.jpg";
---

<section id="home-about-me-section">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-svh">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-2 w-full border-t border-stroke-strong xl:hidden"
    >
      <div
        class="text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl xl:text-[180px] 2xl:text-[280px] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center p-10"
      >
        ABOU
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-l border-stroke-strong text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl xl:text-[180px] 2xl:text-[280px] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        T
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-0 w-full xl:*:h-96">
      <div
        class="hidden xl:flex border-b xl:border-y border-stroke-strong text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl xl:text-[180px] 2xl:text-[280px] font-black font-display col-span-1 xl:col-span-2 h-40 sm:h-48 items-center justify-center"
      >
        ABOU
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-y xl:border border-stroke-strong p-3 sm:p-6 xl:p-12 h-90 sm:h-105 xl:h-120"
      >
        <div class="h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xs relative">
          <Image
            src={MHRafinImage}
            alt="Mahedi Hassan Rafin is sat on a rock near a flowing river in a scenic place."
            class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[12%_25%] origin-[0%_40%] scale-150"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand/80 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="hidden xl:flex border-b xl:border-y border-stroke-strong text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl xl:text-[180px] 2xl:text-[280px] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 items-center justify-center"
      >
        T
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-b border-stroke-strong text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl xl:text-[180px] 2xl:text-[280px] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        M
      </div>
      <p
        class="border-b xl:border-l border-stroke-strong text-justify flex items-center p-5 min-h-40 sm:min-h-56"
      >
        Hey there, I'm Rafin, a Software Engineer. I build things with Python.
        Until now, I've focused on backend systems. Currently I am working on
        some projects that require full stack expertise, so I've been picking up
        frontend along the way. Lately I have been looking into system design
        and how it applies to what I've already built.
      </p>
      <div
        class="border-b xl:border-x border-stroke-strong text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl xl:text-[180px] 2xl:text-[280px] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        E
      </div>
      <p
        class="border-b border-stroke-strong text-justify flex items-center p-5 min-h-40 sm:min-h-56"
      >
        Aside from developing, I like to play some games once in a while. I love
        reading meaningful books. I try to write, I take notes from the books i
        read and work with them on my customised zettelkasten method. One day
        I'd like to publish a book, InshaAllah. Until then, this site is where I
        will be writing about what I'm building, learning, and thinking about.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
